---
import Resumen from "../../layouts/Resumen.astro";

/**
 * The caller is the one asking too often.
 *
 * A separate page from `espera.astro`, for the reason `refugios/entrar/demasiados.astro` is a
 * separate page from `espera.astro`: they are different facts, and the ceiling page's words
 * are false about this one — it says the platform's daily mail is gone and that the caller
 * did nothing, and neither is true here.
 *
 * Both reveal nothing about any address, which is what lets either be spoken at all. This one
 * is a fact about the caller and the other is a fact about the platform;
 * `SPEAKABLE_REFUSALS` is that division as data.
 *
 * **It does not name the limit or the window.** Numbers here would only be useful to somebody
 * pacing themselves against it, and the person this page is actually for — a volunteer
 * walking several visitors through the form on one phone — needs to know it will pass, not
 * how to time it.
 */
---

<Resumen title="Demasiadas solicitudes" heading="Espera un momento">
  <p data-testid="ip-rate-limited">
    Llegaron muchas solicitudes desde tu conexión en poco tiempo, así que esta no la
    procesamos. No es nada del correo que escribiste.
  </p>

  <p>Vuelve a intentarlo dentro de un rato y va a pasar sin problema.</p>

  <p><a href="/resumen">Volver</a></p>
</Resumen>
